### Rejestracja
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "admin",
  "password": "1234"
}


### Logowanie
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "dupa",
  "password": "1234"
}

### zmiana nazwy użytkownika
PATCH http://localhost:3000/auth/update-name
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 2,
  "newName": "Zbychu"
}